==================== Input ====================
/* A word glued to a paren group stays glued: the value writer never inserts
   a space between source-glued tokens.
   DIVERGES from Prettier (DIVERGENCES.md "paren-group-glued-word"), whose
   postcss-values-parser re-splits `$(style)color` into a paren node and a word
   and prints a space between them. */
a {
  color: $(style)color;
  color: @@(style)color123;
  color: @@(style) color123;
}

